Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Solution to 6.2", "Title"],

Cell["``Computational Physics'', J. M. Thijssen", "Subtitle"],

Cell["(a)", "Subsubtitle"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Let us call the the region for ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`A\_n, \ B\_n\)]],
  " [ ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\((n - 1)\) a + \[CapitalDelta]/2\  < \ x < \ 
        n\ a\  - \(\(\[CapitalDelta]/2\)\(\ \)\)\)]],
  "] region 1, ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`C\_n, D\_n\)]],
  " [ ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`n\ a - \[CapitalDelta]/2\  < x < 
        n\ a\  + \[CapitalDelta]/2\)]],
  "] region 2, and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`A\_\(n + 1\), \ B\_\(n + 1\)\)]],
  " [ ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`n\ a + \[CapitalDelta]/2 < 
        x < \((n\  + 1)\) a - \[CapitalDelta]/2\)]],
  "] region 3.  We denote the wavefunctions in these three regions ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_1\)]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_2\)]],
  ", and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_3\)]],
  ". We have\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_1 = 
        A\_n\ e\^\(i\ \(q(x - n\ a)\)\) + \(B\_n\) 
            e\^\(\(-i\)\ \(q(x - n\ a)\)\)\)]],
  ",\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_2 = 
        D\_n\ e\^\(i\ \(k(x - n\ a)\)\) + \(D\_n\) 
            e\^\(\(-i\)\ \(k(x - n\ a)\)\)\)]],
  ",\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_3 = 
        A\_\(n + 1\)\ e\^\(i\ \(q(x - \((n + 1)\)\ a)\)\) + \(B\_\(n + 1\)\) 
            e\^\(\(-i\)\ \(q(x - \((n + 1)\)\ a)\)\)\)]],
  ",\nwhere ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`q\)]],
  " = ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\@\(2  m\ E\)\)]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`k = \@\(2\ \(m(E - V\_0)\)\)\)]],
  ". The equations by matching at boundaries at ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`n\ a\  - \ \[CapitalDelta]/2\)]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`n\ a + \[CapitalDelta]/2\)]],
  " for continuous function and derivative continous are:\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(\(\(\[CapitalPsi]\_\(\(1\)\(\ \)\)\)(
          n\ a - \[CapitalDelta]/2)\  = \ \(\[CapitalPsi]\_2\)(
          n\ a - \[CapitalDelta]/2)\)\(,\)\)\)]],
  "  ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(\(\(\[CapitalPsi]\_\(\(2\)\(\ \)\)\)(
          n\ a + \[CapitalDelta]/2)\  = \ \(\[CapitalPsi]\_3\)(
          n\ a + \[CapitalDelta]/2)\)\(,\)\)\)]],
  "\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(\(\(\(\[CapitalPsi]'\)\_\(\(1\)\(\ \)\)\) \((n\ a \
- \[CapitalDelta]/
                2)\)\  = \ \(\(\[CapitalPsi]'\)\_2\) \((n\ a - \
\[CapitalDelta]/2)\)\)\(,\)\)\)]],
  " ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(\(\[CapitalPsi]'\)\_\(\(2\)\(\ \)\)\) \((n\ a + \
\[CapitalDelta]/
                2)\)\  = \ \(\(\[CapitalPsi]'\)\_3\) \(\((n\ a + \
\[CapitalDelta]/2)\)\(.\)\)\)]],
  "   \nThis gives us the following 4 equations.  Solving for ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`A\_\(n + 1\)\)]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`B\_\(n + 1\)\)]],
  ", eliminating ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`C\_n\)]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`D\_n\)]],
  ", we get  (A and B is ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`A\_n\)]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`B\_n\)]],
  ", A1 and B1 is ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`A\_\(n + 1\), B\_\(n + 1\)\)]],
  "):"
}], "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[{
    \(\(eq1 = 
        A*Exp[\(-I\)*q*\[CapitalDelta]/2] + 
            B*Exp[I*q*\[CapitalDelta]/2] \[Equal] 
          Cn*Exp[\(-I\)*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2]\  + 
            Dn*Exp[I*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2];\)\), "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    \(\(eq2 = 
        q*A*Exp[\(-I\)*q*\[CapitalDelta]/2] - 
            q*B*Exp[I*q*\[CapitalDelta]/2] \[Equal] 
          k*Cn*Exp[\(-I\)*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2]\  - 
            k*Dn*Exp[I*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2];\)\), "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    \(\(eq3 = 
        Cn*Exp[I*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2] + 
            Dn*Exp[\(-I\)*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2] \[Equal] 
          A1*Exp[I*q*\((\[CapitalDelta]/2 - a)\)]\  + 
            B1*Exp[\(-I\)*
                  q*\((\[CapitalDelta]/2 - 
                      a)\)];\)\), "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    \(\(eq4 = 
        k*Cn*Exp[I*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2] - 
            k*Dn*Exp[\(-I\)*k*\[CapitalDelta]/2] \[Equal] 
          q*A1*Exp[I*q*\((\[CapitalDelta]/2 - a)\)]\  - 
            q*B1*Exp[\(-I\)*q*\((\[CapitalDelta]/2 - a)\)];\)\)}], "Input"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(res\  = 
      Solve[{eq1, eq2, eq3, eq4}, {A1, B1}, {Cn, Dn}]\  // \ 
        Simplify\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \({{A1 \[Rule] \(\(1\/\(4\ k\ q\)\)\((\[ExponentialE]\^\(\[ImaginaryI]\ \
\((a\ q - \((k + q)\)\ \[CapitalDelta])\)\)\ \((\(-B\)\ \[ExponentialE]\^\(\
\[ImaginaryI]\ q\ \[CapitalDelta]\)\ \((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \
\[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ \((\(-k\^2\) + q\^2)\) + 
                  A\ \((\((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \
\[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ k\^2 + 
                        2\ \((1 + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \
\[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ k\ q + \((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ \
k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ q\^2)\))\))\)\), 
        B1 \[Rule] \(-\(\(1\/\(4\ k\ q\)\)\((\[ExponentialE]\^\(\(-\
\[ImaginaryI]\)\ \((a\ q + k\ \[CapitalDelta])\)\)\ \((A\ \((\(-1\) + \
\[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ \((k\^2 - 
                          q\^2)\) + 
                    B\ \[ExponentialE]\^\(\[ImaginaryI]\ q\ \[CapitalDelta]\)\
\ \((\((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\
\ k\^2 - 2\ \((1 + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\
\)\ k\ q + \((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \
\[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ q\^2)\))\))\)\)\)}}\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Now ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`T\_ij\)]],
  " for part (a) is computed as following:"
}], "Text"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(T11\  = \ 
      Simplify[\(\((4*k/q)\)*A1\  /. \ res[\([1]\)]\)\  /. \ {A \[Rule] 1, \ 
            B \[Rule] \ 0}]\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(\(\[ExponentialE]\^\(\[ImaginaryI]\ \((a\ q - \((k + q)\)\ \
\[CapitalDelta])\)\)\ \((\((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \
\[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ k\^2 + 2\ \((1 + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\
\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ k\ q + \((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \
\[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ q\^2)\)\)\/q\^2\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(T22\  = 
      Simplify[\ \(\((4*k/q)\)*B1\  /. \ 
            res[\([1]\)]\)\  /. \ {A \[Rule] \ 0, \ 
            B \[Rule] \ 1}]\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(\(\[ExponentialE]\^\(\(-\[ImaginaryI]\)\ \((a\ q + \((k - q)\)\ \
\[CapitalDelta])\)\)\ \((\(-\((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ \
k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\)\ k\^2 + 2\ \((1 + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \
\[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ k\ q - \((\(-1\) + \
\[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ q\^2)\)\)\/q\^2\
\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(T12\  = \ 
      Simplify[\(\((4*k/q)\)*A1\  /. \ res[\([1]\)]\)\  /. \ {A \[Rule] 0, \ 
            B \[Rule] \ 1}]\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(\(-\(\(\[ExponentialE]\^\(\[ImaginaryI]\ \((a\ q - k\ \
\[CapitalDelta])\)\)\ \((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \
\[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ \((\(-k\^2\) + q\^2)\)\)\/q\^2\)\)\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(T21\  = \ 
      Simplify[\(\((4*k/q)\)*B1\  /. \ res[\([1]\)]\)\  /. \ {A \[Rule] 1, \ 
            B \[Rule] \ 0}]\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(\(\[ExponentialE]\^\(\(-\[ImaginaryI]\)\ \((a\ q + k\ \
\[CapitalDelta])\)\)\ \((\(-1\) + \[ExponentialE]\^\(2\ \[ImaginaryI]\ k\ \
\[CapitalDelta]\))\)\ \((\(-k\^2\) + q\^2)\)\)\/q\^2\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Check ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`T\_ij\)]],
  " against with textbook result on page 142.  (checked)"
}], "Text"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(Simplify[
      T11\  - \ Exp[
            I*q*\((a - \[CapitalDelta])\)]*\((Exp[
                  I*k*\[CapitalDelta]]*\((1 + k/q)\)^2\  - \ 
              Exp[\(-I\)*k*\[CapitalDelta]]*\((1 - k/q)\)^2)\)]\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(0\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(Simplify[
      T12\  - \ \((\(-2\)*I*Exp[I*q*a] \((1 - k^2/q^2)\)*
            Sin[k*\[CapitalDelta]])\)]\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(0\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["(b)", "Subsubtitle"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "The determinant and trace of the matrix ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`T\)]],
  " has a simple result."
}], "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(\(T = \((q/\((4  k)\))\)*{{T11, T12}, {T21, T22}};\)\)], "Input"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(Det[T]\  // \ Simplify\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(1\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(tr\  = \ FullSimplify[T[\([1, 1]\)] + T[\([2, 2]\)]]\)], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(\(\((k + q)\)\^2\ Cos[a\ q + \((k - q)\)\ \[CapitalDelta]] - \((k - \
q)\)\^2\ Cos[a\ q - \((k + q)\)\ \[CapitalDelta]]\)\/\(2\ k\ q\)\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
  "So the eigenvalues of ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`T\)]],
  " have the property:\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(\[Lambda]\_1\) \[Lambda]\_2 = \(1\  = \ 
          Det(T)\)\)]],
  ",  ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      FormBox[
        RowBox[{\(\[Lambda]\_1 + \[Lambda]\_2\), "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Tr", Cell[TextData[{
              Cell[BoxData[
                  \(TraditionalForm\`\(\((T)\)\(=\)\)\)]],
              " tr"
            }]]}]}], TraditionalForm]]],
  ".\nWe note that ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_1\)]],
  "and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[CapitalPsi]\_3\)]],
  " are the wavefuctions at different period of the potential, thus by Bloch \
theorem, they most be related as ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\(\[CapitalPsi]\_1\)(
          x - a) = \(e\^\(\(-i\)\ p\ a\)\) \(\(\[CapitalPsi]\_3\)(x)\)\)]],
  ", in term of the coefficients ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`A\)]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`B\)]],
  ",this means that ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`A\_\(n + 1\) = \ \(e\^\(i\ p\ a\)\) A\_n\)]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`B\_\(n + 1\) = \(e\^\(i\ p\ a\)\) B\_n\)]],
  ".  Since\n",
  Cell[BoxData[
      FormBox[
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"T", " ", 
            RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
                  {\(A\_n\)},
                  {\(B\_n\)}
                  }], ")"}]}], "=", 
          RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
                {\(A\_\(n + 1\)\)},
                {\(B\_\(n + 1\)\)}
                }], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]]],
  ", we conclude that the eigenvalues of ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`T\)]],
  " must be ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`e\^\(i\ p\ a\)\)]],
  ", where ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`p\)]],
  " is the lattice momentum in Bloch theorem.  For each energy ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`E\)]],
  " the two eigenvalues correspond to two momenta with equal magnitude and \
opposite in sign.  Let ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[Lambda]\_1 = e\^\(i\ p\ a\)\)]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[Lambda]\_2 = e\^\(\(-i\)\ p\ a\)\)]],
  ", ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[Lambda]\_1*\[Lambda]\_2 = 1\)]],
  " is automatically satisfied, we have ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[Lambda]\_1 + \[Lambda]\_2 = \ 
        2\ \(cos(p\ a)\)\)]],
  " = tr.  A plot of the spetrum for ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`p\ a\)]],
  " vs ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`E\)]],
  " is given here. [Choosing the following constants]"
}], "Text"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
    \(\(nvalues = {V0\  -> 1.0, a -> 1.0, \[CapitalDelta] -> 0.2, \ 
          m -> 1.0};\)\), "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    \(spectrap[e_]\  = \ 
      Simplify[\(ArcCos[tr/2]\  /. \ {q\  \[Rule] \ Sqrt[2*m*e], \ 
              k \[Rule] \ Sqrt[2*m*\((e - V0)\)]}\)\  /. \ 
          nvalues]\)}], "Input"],

Cell[BoxData[
    \(ArcCos[\(1\/\(\@\(\(-1.`\) + e\)\ \@e\)\)\((\((\(\(0.25000000000000006`\
\)\(\[InvisibleSpace]\)\) + 0.5000000000000001`\ \@\(\(-1.`\) + e\)\ \@e - 
                0.5000000000000001`\ e)\)\ Cos[
              0.28284271247461906`\ \@\(\(-1.`\) + e\) - 
                1.131370849898476`\ \@e] + \((\(-0.25000000000000006`\) + 
                0.5000000000000001`\ \@\(\(-1.`\) + e\)\ \@e + 
                0.5000000000000001`\ e)\)\ Cos[
              0.28284271247461906`\ \@\(\(-1.`\) + e\) + 
                1.131370849898476`\ \@e])\)]\)], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
    \(ParametricPlot[{{spectrap[e], e}, {\(-spectrap[e]\), e}}, {e, 0.196, \ 
        30.0}]\)], "Input"],

Cell[GraphicsData["PostScript", "\<\
